  "body": "Delivered the complete independent augmentation B01 result-closeout scientific review for the fixed task at 53f9f10aa8612da7375ef7c8e2492670fb53801f.\n\n[Read the complete review at delivery commit 4da68fe7a9577a0bc32a00d6fc7c7e7412e50568](https://github.com/CartmanFatass/My-paper-code/blob/4da68fe7a9577a0bc32a00d6fc7c7e7412e50568/docs/research/candidates/vap_folr_core/pro_packets/20260914_augmentation_b01_result_closeout_review/archive/RESPONSE.md).\n\nAll 112 lines, including reference definitions, were read back at that commit. Comparison with its actual parent 4be6c39962ad660cdc5e8d605866b76b0db11b31 confirms that the delivery commit adds only the authorized RESPONSE.md on codex/vap-folr; concurrent branch changes are preserved.\n\nThe review identifies no result-invalidating defect in the documented A–G comparison. It preserves the bounded AUGMENTED_ABOVE_MEI reading, distinguishes whole-program benefit from persistence attribution and training-population inference, and provides minor reporting precisions and closeout caveats for the DM response. Historical E/F/B02/B03 evidence, the missed prediction and unknown full costs remain intact.\n\nThis is current-task scientific closeout under the pinned owner pause. No successor, lifecycle verdict, resource grant, experiment, code execution, checkpoint load, raw-result reanalysis or new consultation was selected or performed. No other repository file, prior response or branch was modified by this delivery.",
